{
  "id": "npc_liuruyan",
  "title": "柳如烟对话",
  "description": "天剑盟弟子柳如烟的日常对话",
  "start_node": "greeting",
  "metadata": {
    "npc_id": "liuruyan",
    "npc_name": "柳如烟",
    "location": "天剑盟"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "你来了？盟中事务繁忙，难得有片刻清静练剑。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_sect",
          "text": "天剑盟是怎样的门派？",
          "next_node": "sect_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_cultivation",
          "text": "最近修炼可有心得？",
          "next_node": "cultivation_talk",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "liuruyan",
              "value": 10,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_news",
          "text": "江湖上有什么新鲜事？",
          "next_node": "news"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "告辞",
          "next_node": "END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sect_intro",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "天剑盟以剑立派，执九州正道牛耳。盟中弟子修的不只是剑术，更是「守护」二字——剑为百兵之君，当为苍生而出。",
      "emotion": "confident",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "liuruyan",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "了解天剑盟"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_admire",
          "text": "以剑护道，令人敬佩",
          "next_node": "admire_response",
          "dao_heart_hint": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_doubt",
          "text": "正道之名，未免拘束",
          "next_node": "doubt_response",
          "dao_heart_hint": -2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "admire_response",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "难得你有这份心。世人只道天剑盟弟子高高在上，却不知手中之剑为谁而握。",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "liuruyan",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "理解天剑盟理念"
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 2,
          "reason": "包容看待不同修炼之道"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "doubt_response",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "哼，拘束？若无执剑护道之人，这九州早成了魔道的猎场。自由与责任，从来一体。",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "liuruyan",
          "value": -3,
          "reason": "质疑正道拘束"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "cultivation_talk",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "最近在参悟一式家传剑招，据说需以剑意淬炼心神方能大成。只是每每练到紧要处，总觉得还差了一线...",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "liuruyan",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "交流修炼心得"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_warn",
          "text": "剑意过刚易折，还请循序渐进",
          "next_node": "warn_response"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_help",
          "text": "若有需要，我可以帮忙寻来名剑谱参阅",
          "next_node": "help_response"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "warn_response",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "...你的关心我记下了。放心，我自有分寸。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "liuruyan",
          "value": 2,
          "reason": "关心安危"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "help_response",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "哦？你倒是爽快。若真有心相助，日后我自会找你。",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "liuruyan",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "主动提出帮助"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "news",
      "speaker": "liuruyan",
      "text": "听说天机阁的玄机真人最近频繁推演天象，似乎预见了什么大变。各派都在暗中准备。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "next_node": "END"
    }
  ]
}
